          <!-- EDIT THIS MESSAGE TO CHANGE THE IRIS WINDOW TEXT -->
          <strong>"And I don't want the world to see me<br>'cause I don't think that they'd understand."</strong><br><br>
          I think about this line a lot, Aki. You're someone who keeps your most important feelings to yourself and it's not because you don't have them, but because the world doesn't always deserve them.<br><br>
          This song is ours. But this line especially feels like you.<br>I'm glad, Aki. Thank you for letting me close enough to hear it anyway.
